  Checklist                                                                     
                                                                                
  > Modul pertama yang dibangun. Modul ini jadi fondasi untuk semua modul lain  
  (wallet, api-keys, dll bergantung ke `CurrentUser` & `RolesGuard` dari sini). 
                                                                                
  ---                                                                           
                                                                                
  ## 1. Scope Fitur                                                             
                                                                                
  - [ ] Register (email + password)                                             
  - [ ] Login (email + password) → access token + refresh token                 
  - [ ] Refresh token (rotation, dengan reuse detection)                        
  - [ ] Logout (revoke refresh token)                                           
  - [ ] Forgot password (kirim link/token reset ke email)                       
  - [ ] Reset password                                                          
  - [ ] Email verification                                                      
  - [ ] Guard untuk proteksi route (`JwtAuthGuard`)                             
  - [ ] Role-based access (`RolesGuard`) — role: `user`, `pro`, `admin`,        
  `superadmin`                                                                  
  - [ ] Rate limiting di endpoint auth (anti brute-force)                       
                                                                                
  ---                                                                           
                                                                                
  ## 2. Struktur Folder                                                         
                                                                                
  ```                                                                           
  src/modules/auth/                                                             
  ├── auth.module.ts                                                            
  ├── auth.controller.ts                                                        
  ├── auth.service.ts                                                           
  ├── auth.constants.ts                                                         
  ├── dto/                                                                      
  │   ├── register.dto.ts                                                       
  │   ├── login.dto.ts                                                          
  │   ├── refresh-token.dto.ts                                                  
  │   ├── forgot-password.dto.ts                                                
  │   └── reset-password.dto.ts                                                 
  ├── strategies/                                                               
  │   ├── jwt-access.strategy.ts                                                
  │   └── jwt-refresh.strategy.ts                                               
  ├── guards/                                                                   
  │   ├── jwt-auth.guard.ts                                                     
  │   ├── jwt-refresh.guard.ts                                                  
  │   └── roles.guard.ts                                                        
  ├── decorators/                                                               
  │   ├── current-user.decorator.ts                                             
  │   └── roles.decorator.ts                                                    
  └── interfaces/                                                               
      └── jwt-payload.interface.ts                                              
                                                                                
  src/database/drizzle/schema/                                                  
  ├── users.schema.ts                                                           
  └── refresh-tokens.schema.ts                                                  
  ```                                                                           
                                                                                
  ---                                                                           
                                                                                
  ## 3. Endpoint Table                                                          
                                                                                
  | Method | Route | Guard | Rate Limit | Deskripsi |                           
  |---|---|---|---|---|                                                         
  | POST | `/auth/register` | - | 5/menit/IP | Daftar user baru |               
  | POST | `/auth/login` | - | 5/menit/IP | Login, return access + refresh      
  token |                                                                       
  | POST | `/auth/refresh` | `JwtRefreshGuard` | 10/menit/IP | Rotasi refresh   
  token |                                                                       
  | POST | `/auth/logout` | `JwtAuthGuard` | - | Revoke refresh token |         
  | POST | `/auth/forgot-password` | - | 3/jam/IP | Kirim email reset |         
  | POST | `/auth/reset-password` | - | 5/jam/IP | Set password baru pakai      
  token |                                                                       
  | GET | `/auth/me` | `JwtAuthGuard` | - | Info user login saat ini |          
                                                                                
